    Armed --> Valid3[Valid: Proclamation allowed]
    Internal --> Invalid[Invalid: No proclamation]
    Valid1 --> End[Emergency proclaimed]
    Valid2 --> End
    Valid3 --> End
    Invalid --> EndInvalid[No emergency]
